'''Total War: Summer Special''' (大乱闘 夏イベスペシャル ''Dai Rantō Natsu Ibesupesharu'', '''Great Free-for-All: Summer Eve Special''') is the Summer [[Total Wars|Total War]]. It is unlocked after clearing [[The Forbidden Bride (Monthly Event)|The Forbidden Bride]], [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Summer!]] and [[Ghostly Houseguests (Monthly Event)|Ghostly Houseguests]], and contains enemies from all three events. It was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

